    "description": "<p><em>Finger of death</em> creates a death ray that will kill any one living creature within 60'. The victim may make a saving throw vs. death ray to avoid the effect. A Lawful cleric will only use <em>finger of death</em> in a life-or-death situation. <em>Finger of death</em> will actually cure 3d10 (3–30) points of damage for any undead with 10 or more Hit Dice (phantom, haunt, spirit, nightshade, or special).</p>",
